00:36:04,320 --> 00:36:07,199
LHIG DA NY JOUILL VEGGEY FEST NISH REN

632
00:36:07,199 --> 00:36:09,090
EH CAGHLAA AIGNEY DY SIYRAGH

633
00:36:10,710 --> 00:36:14,070
VEAGH DOOINNEY PURT NY HINSHEY GRA CUR RISH

634
00:36:14,070 --> 00:36:16,860
CEAU MAGH YN LIEEN AS VEAGH DOOINNEY PURT

635
00:36:16,860 --> 00:36:20,039
LE MOIRREY GRA CUIRR RISH ER LHIAM DY

636
00:36:20,039 --> 00:36:22,380
RE CUIRR YN RED SDOOGHYSSAGH DY GHRA RISH

637
00:36:23,099 --> 00:36:25,349
AGH NISH DOOINNEY PURT LE MOIRREY VA NEDDY

638
00:36:25,380 --> 00:36:30,179
BEG ER E AYR

639
00:36:32,340 --> 00:36:34,559
NEDDY BEG GYS YN EEASTAGH SCADDAN ER E

640
00:36:34,559 --> 00:36:37,050
VAC AS TA NY BAATYN GOLL SHIAGHEY AYNS

641
00:36:37,050 --> 00:36:38,549
DOOLISH OLLAN EAISHTAGH SHEN

642
00:36:39,780 --> 00:36:42,269
AS VOISH ABBYR SHEN REESHT SHENNAYR YN CHEER

643
00:36:42,269 --> 00:36:48,869
SHOH SNIEU SAA WELL

644
00:36:49,949 --> 00:36:54,179
ISLAY JELUNE AS BLEIN VIE NOA I SAVOIA

645
00:36:54,210 --> 00:36:59,159
ISLEOFARCH AFORESAID INJIL YNLHOAMEY VEAGH YN EDDIN FEERVAYNREY

646
00:36:59,159 --> 00:37:02,760
HISPANIOLA LHIAMLHIAT CHENGEY FODDEE CHA LHIATTEE HIE HERMANN

647
00:37:03,599 --> 00:37:05,940
DYLLEE Y HIE PEDDYR HEESE ER DTY HIE

648
00:37:05,940 --> 00:37:11,429
PILATE IN HIS OF AFORESAID VEIH-SHOH ISAIAH GHIASTYLLYS

649
00:37:11,429 --> 00:37:15,150
IS LAA HIE YN PHOSSAN SHOH CHAIE

650
00:37:17,909 --> 00:37:19,169
ISHIN BY VIE

